<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="feast-flow-1124" name="Feast 흐름"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Feast 흐름: 피처 정의 등록 → 매시 데이터 적재 → 추론 서버 조회 (2026-11-24 기준, DML 코드에서 확인)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="900" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="&lt;b&gt;① 정의 등록 — definitions.py가 바뀌어 main에 머지될 때만&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#534AB7;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="48" width="600" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="&lt;b&gt;② 데이터 — 매시 Airflow DAG (뒤 DAG가 ExternalTaskSensor로 같은 시간의 앞 DAG를 기다림)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#534AB7;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="188" width="600" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="&lt;b&gt;③ 서빙 — 요청마다&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#534AB7;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="488" width="600" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="&lt;b&gt;definitions.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;entity 2 · feature view 4&lt;br&gt;feature service ctr_lgbm_v1&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F1EFE8;strokeColor=#5F5E5A;fontColor=#444441;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="78" width="160" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub Actions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;feast-apply.yml&lt;br&gt;PR: feast plan / main: feast apply&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EEEDFE;strokeColor=#534AB7;fontColor=#3C3489;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="78" width="180" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value="&lt;b&gt;GCS registry.pb&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;정의 목록 + view별 적재 끝 시각&lt;br&gt;버킷 versioning&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E1F5EE;strokeColor=#0F6E56;fontColor=#085041;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="78" width="170" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" value="main 머지" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n5" target="n6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" value="정의 쓰기 (데이터는 안 옮김)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n6" target="n7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" value="&lt;b&gt;GCS 로그 버킷&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;served/ · actions/ (JSONL)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E1F5EE;strokeColor=#0F6E56;fontColor=#085041;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="218" width="160" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" value="&lt;b&gt;load_raw&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;매시 · 앞 3시간 다시 봄&lt;br&gt;PR #33&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EEEDFE;strokeColor=#534AB7;fontColor=#3C3489;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="218" width="160" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" value="&lt;b&gt;BigQuery raw&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;raw.served · raw.actions&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E1F5EE;strokeColor=#0F6E56;fontColor=#085041;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="218" width="160" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n13" value="&lt;b&gt;clean_events&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;매시 · load_raw 뒤&lt;br&gt;PR #35&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EEEDFE;strokeColor=#534AB7;fontColor=#3C3489;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="218" width="160" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" value="&lt;b&gt;BigQuery clean&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;중복 제거 · fraud click 판정&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E1F5EE;strokeColor=#0F6E56;fontColor=#085041;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="218" width="160" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" value="&lt;b&gt;build_feast_sources&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;매시 · clean_events 뒤&lt;br&gt;PR #39&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EEEDFE;strokeColor=#534AB7;fontColor=#3C3489;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="218" width="160" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" value="&lt;b&gt;BigQuery Feast 원천 표&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;article_profile · reader_profile&lt;br&gt;reader_activity · reader_article&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E1F5EE;strokeColor=#0F6E56;fontColor=#085041;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="218" width="160" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" value="&lt;b&gt;feast_materialize&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;매시 · 원천 표 뒤 (PR #41)&lt;br&gt;materialize_incremental&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EEEDFE;strokeColor=#534AB7;fontColor=#3C3489;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1350" y="218" width="170" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n18" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n10" target="n11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n11" target="n12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n20" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n12" target="n13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n21" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n13" target="n14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n22" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n14" target="n15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n23" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n15" target="n16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n24" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n16" target="n17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n25" value="&lt;b&gt;Cloud SQL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;public.news_articles&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F1EFE8;strokeColor=#5F5E5A;fontColor=#444441;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="330" width="160" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n26" value="&lt;b&gt;embed_articles&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;매시 · 새 기사만 최대 500건&lt;br&gt;e5-base 768칸 (PR #37)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EEEDFE;strokeColor=#534AB7;fontColor=#3C3489;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="330" width="160" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n27" value="&lt;b&gt;BigQuery feat&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;article_embedding · article_meta&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E1F5EE;strokeColor=#0F6E56;fontColor=#085041;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="330" width="160" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n28" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n25" target="n26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n29" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n26" target="n27"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n30" value="u_emb 재료" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n27" target="n15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n31" value="&lt;b&gt;training set&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;get_historical_features&lt;br&gt;103,244행 · 80.8초 (원인 조사 중)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F1EFE8;strokeColor=#5F5E5A;fontColor=#444441;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="330" width="160" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n32" value="point-in-time join" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n16" target="n31"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n33" value="Q4 정의 읽기 · 적재 끝 시각 쓰기" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#B7950B;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n17" target="n7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1435" y="107"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n34" value="&lt;b&gt;뉴스 WAS (태원)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;후보 리트리벌 끝난 뒤 호출&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F1EFE8;strokeColor=#5F5E5A;fontColor=#444441;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="518" width="160" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n35" value="&lt;b&gt;추론 서버 POST /v1/rank&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;reader_id 1 + candidates ≤200 → 한 요청&lt;br&gt;FastAPI · LightGBM · Feast SDK&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EEEDFE;strokeColor=#534AB7;fontColor=#3C3489;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="518" width="220" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n36" value="&lt;b&gt;Valkey (online store)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;피처 값만 · 키 = entity&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E1F5EE;strokeColor=#0F6E56;fontColor=#085041;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1350" y="518" width="170" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n37" value="Q5 후보 200개를 한 번에" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n34" target="n35"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n38" value="바뀐 행만 덮어쓰기" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n17" target="n36"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n39" value="Q3 get_online_features 1번 → feature view별 HMGET 파이프라인" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#B7950B;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n35" target="n36"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n40" value="Q1·Q2 시작 때 읽기 + TTL 600초 뒤 첫 요청 때 다시 읽기" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#B7950B;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n7" target="n35"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="522" y="470"/><mxPoint x="510" y="470"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n41" value="&lt;b&gt;멘토 질문 (11/19 멘토링) — 그림의 Q 번호 선과 짝&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#5C4A00;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="615" width="1100" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n42" value="&lt;b&gt;Q1 서버가 뜰 때 GCS registry를 읽나?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;읽는다. 추론 서버가 시작할 때 FeatureStore(feature_store.gcp.yaml)를 만들면 registry.pb를 GCS에서 읽어 메모리에 둔다. 서버는 apply를 하지 않고 정의를 읽기만 한다. 그래서 inference-server 서비스 계정은 feast/ 경로 읽기 권한만 받는다(infra #64).&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=11.5;fillColor=#FFF8DD;strokeColor=#B7950B;fontColor=#5C4A00;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="645" width="292" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n43" value="&lt;b&gt;Q2 주기적으로는 어떻게 읽나? 스케줄링을 걸었나?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;스케줄링은 없다. Feast RegistryConfig 기본값 cache_ttl_seconds=600, cache_mode=sync다. 600초가 지난 뒤 registry가 필요한 첫 요청이 GCS를 다시 읽는다. 그 한 요청만 GCS 읽기만큼 느려진다. cache_mode=thread로 바꾸면 백그라운드 스레드가 갱신한다(아직 안 정함).&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=11.5;fillColor=#FFF8DD;strokeColor=#B7950B;fontColor=#5C4A00;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="322" y="645" width="292" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n44" value="&lt;b&gt;Q3 서버의 Feast 코드가 Valkey를 계속 호출하나?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;요청 1건에 get_online_features 1번이다. Feast가 feature view마다 중복 entity를 지운 뒤 Redis 파이프라인 HMGET으로 한 번에 읽는다. reader_profile·reader_activity는 독자 키 1개, article_profile은 후보 200개, reader_article은 (독자, 기사) 200쌍이다. registry는 Valkey에 없다.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=11.5;fillColor=#FFF8DD;strokeColor=#B7950B;fontColor=#5C4A00;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="624" y="645" width="292" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n45" value="&lt;b&gt;Q4 배치가 등록하면 GCS와 어떻게 연동되나?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;정의는 main 머지 때 GitHub Actions가 feast apply로 registry.pb에 쓴다. 데이터는 feast_materialize가 원천 표에서 Valkey로 옮기고, 적재 끝 시각을 registry에 다시 쓴다. 다음 실행은 그 시각부터 이어서 읽는다. apply 전에는 materialize DAG를 멈춘다.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=11.5;fillColor=#FFF8DD;strokeColor=#B7950B;fontColor=#5C4A00;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="926" y="645" width="292" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n46" value="&lt;b&gt;Q5 후보 200개면 요청이 200번인가? 지연 목표는?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;한 요청으로 묶는다(candidates 최대 200). 독자 피처는 1번만 조회한다. P99 200ms 목표는 아직 측정 전이다. 로컬 SQLite에서 독자 1 + 후보 10은 약 23ms였다.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=11.5;fillColor=#FFF8DD;strokeColor=#B7950B;fontColor=#5C4A00;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1228" y="645" width="292" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n47" value="초록 = 저장소 · 보라 = 실행 · 회색 = 코드·외부 · 노랑 = 멘토 질문 · 점선 테두리 = 클러스터에서 아직 안 돌려 봄 · 점선 아님 + 회색 선 = 확인한 흐름" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#555555;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="805" width="1500" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
